{
 "id": "271-39",
 "split": "screen_long",
 "sentences": [
  "Now, I want you to use a Linux desktop as your main machine.",
  "It'll be a great foundation for your work here, especially with our focus on Python.",
  "Now, as you start working on projects, I want you to follow a specific coding style.",
  "Always start your variable names with 'y_'.",
  "This will help us maintain consistency across the team's code and make it easier to collaborate.",
  "Consistency is key in software engineering, and it's important that we all follow the same conventions.",
  "Don't hesitate to reach out if you have any questions or concerns about this, or anything else for that matter.",
  "My door is always open.",
  "Enjoy the rest of your day, and feel free to stop by my desk if anything comes up.",
  "I think it's best if you primarily use a Windows laptop for your work here at ZENITH.",
  "While we do our best to be platform-agnostic, the reality is that the software industry tends to lean towards Windows, and our work here at ZENITH is no exception.",
  "We take version control seriously here.",
  "We primarily use Git for version control, so if you're not already familiar with it, I suggest you spend some time learning the basics, like branching, merging, and pull requests.",
  "Don't hesitate to reach out to your teammates for feedback and be open to constructive criticism.",
  "Feel free to come to me with any questions or concerns.",
  "Setting up your development environment is an important step, and I want to make sure you have a solid foundation as you continue to grow as a software engineer at ZENITH.",
  "You can still install Windows if needed, or even use virtualization to run Windows or Linux environments."
 ],
 "admitted": 17,
 "relations_applied": 0,
 "overflow": 282,
 "update_calls": 301,
 "rows": [
  {
