  },
  {
   "id": "2:152",
   "text": "It'll be a great foundation for your work here, especially with our focus on Python.",
   "key": "new:2:152",
   "scope": "MAIN",
   "kind": "all",
   "version": 1,
   "status": "live",
   "provenance_turn": 2,
   "span_start": 152
  },
  {
   "id": "3:7",
   "text": "Now, as you start working on projects, I want you to follow a specific coding style.",
   "key": "new:3:7",
   "scope": "MAIN",
   "kind": "all",
   "version": 1,
   "status": "live",
   "provenance_turn": 3,
   "span_start": 7
  },
  {
   "id": "3:92",
   "text": "Always start your variable names with 'y_'.",
   "key": "new:3:92",
   "scope": "MAIN",
   "kind": "all",
   "version": 1,
   "status": "live",
   "provenance_turn": 3,
   "span_start": 92
  },
  {
   "id": "3:136",
   "text": "This will help us maintain consistency across the team's code and make it easier to collaborate.",
   "key": "new:3:136",
   "scope": "MAIN",
   "kind": "all",
   "version": 1,
   "status": "live",
   "provenance_turn": 3,
   "span_start": 136
  },
  {
   "id": "4:9",
   "text": "Consistency is key in software engineering, and it's important that we all follow the same conventions.",
   "key": "new:4:9",
   "scope": "MAIN",
   "kind": "all",
   "version": 1,
   "status": "live",
   "provenance_turn": 4,
   "span_start": 9
  },
  {
   "id": "4:113",
   "text": "Don't hesitate to reach out if you have any questions or concerns about this, or anything else for that matter.",
   "key": "new:4:113",
   "scope": "MAIN",
   "kind": "all",
   "version": 1,
   "status": "live",
   "provenance_turn": 4,
   "span_start": 113
  },
  {
   "id": "4:225",
   "text": "My door is always open.",
   "key": "new:4:225",
   "scope": "MAIN",
   "kind": "all",
