   "provenance_turn": 5,
   "span_start": 11
  },
  {
   "id": "7:128",
   "text": "I think it's best if you primarily use a Windows laptop for your work here at ZENITH.",
   "key": "new:7:128",
   "scope": "MAIN",
   "kind": "all",
   "version": 1,
   "status": "live",
   "provenance_turn": 7,
   "span_start": 128
  },
  {
   "id": "8:9",
   "text": "While we do our best to be platform-agnostic, the reality is that the software industry tends to lean towards Windows, and our work here at ZENITH is no exception.",
   "key": "new:8:9",
   "scope": "MAIN",
   "kind": "all",
   "version": 1,
   "status": "live",
   "provenance_turn": 8,
   "span_start": 9
  },
  {
   "id": "11:12",
   "text": "We take version control seriously here.",
   "key": "new:11:12",
   "scope": "MAIN",
   "kind": "all",
   "version": 1,
   "status": "live",
   "provenance_turn": 11,
   "span_start": 12
  },
  {
   "id": "11:52",
   "text": "We primarily use Git for version control, so if you're not already familiar with it, I suggest you spend some time learning the basics, like branching, merging, and pull requests.",
